$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
7-(2,3-O-Isopropylidene-5-O-tert-butyldimethylsilyl-β-D-ribofuranosyl)-4-phenyl-7H-pyrrolo[
2,3-d]pyrimidine (10d). An argon purged mixture of compound 8 (309 mg,
0.7 mmol), phenylboronic acid (128 mg, 1.05 mmol), K2CO3 (193 mg, 1.4
mmol) and Pd(PPh3)4 (41 mg, 0.035 mmol) in toluene (5 mL) was stirred at
100 °C for 5 h. The mixture was diluted with chloroform (20 mL) and
washed with aqueous NH4Cl (sat., 20 mL). The aqueous phase was
re-extracted with chloroform (2×5 mL) and the combined organic extracts
dried over MgSO4, concentrated in vacuo and the residue chromatographed
on silica (hexanes-AcOEt, 10:1→7:1) to afford 10d (320 mg, 95%) as a
colorless oil.
5-Chloro-4-(furan-3-yl)-7-(2,3,5-tri-O-benzoyl-β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-
d]pyrimidine (18m). Compound 18m was prepared as described for 10d by
coupling compound 17 and furane-3-boronic acid. Yellowish foam. Yield
86%. 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3): 4.70 (dd, 1H, J gem= 12.2, J 5´b,4´= 3.7,
H-5´b); 4.81 (ddd, 1H,J 4´,3´ = 4.4, J 4´,5´ = 3.7, 3.1, H-4´); 4.89 (dd,
1H, J gem= 12.2,J 5´a,4´ = 3.1, H-5´a); 6.12 (dd, 1H, J 3´,2´ = 5.8, J
3´,4´ = 4.4, H-3´); 6.17 (dd, 1H, J 2´,3´ = 5.8, J 2´,1´ = 5.6, H-2´);
6.79 (d, 1H, J 1´,2´ = 5.6, H-1´); 7.06 (dd, 1H, J 4,5 = 1.9, J 4,2= 0.8,
H-4-furyl); 7.37 (m, 2H, H-m-Bz); 7.39 (s, 1H, H-6); 7.41 and 7.50 (2 ×
m, 2 × 2H, H-m-Bz); 7.53 (dd, 1H,J 5,4 = 1.9, J 5,2 = 1.5, H-5-furyl);
7.54, 7.58 and 7.61 (3 × m, 3 × 1H, H-p-Bz); 7.94, 8.00 and 8.14 (3 × m,
3 × 2H, H-o-Bz); 8.18 (dd, 1H, J 2,5= 1.5,J 2,4 = 0.8, H-2-furyl); 8.86
(s, 1H, H-2). 13C NMR (151 MHz, CDCl3): 63.60 (CH2-5´); 71.40 (CH-3´);
73.93 (CH-2´); 80.38 (CH-4´); 85.97 (CH-1´); 105.89 (C-5); 111.32
(CH-4-furyl); 113.70 (C-4a); 123.13 (C-3-furyl); 123.25 (CH-6); 128.39
(C-i-Bz); 128.49 and 128.54 (CH-m- Bz); 128.65 (C-i-Bz); 128.73
(CH-m-Bz); 129.29 (C-i-Bz); 129.69, 129.82 and 129.84 (CH-o-Bz); 133.53,
133.74 and 133.75 (CH.Bz); 143.01 (CH-5-furyl); 145.42
(CH-2-furyl);150.92 (C-7a); 152.02 (CH-2); 152.54 (C-4); 165.10, 165.39
and 166.14 (CO). MS FAB, m/z (rel. %): 445 (50), 664 (100)[M+H]. HR MS
(FAB): calcd for C36H27ClN3O8 [M+H] 664.1487, found 664.1467.
