$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
4-Amino-5-(3,4-dimethylphenyl)-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine(1t).
An argon-purged mixture of
4-amino-5-iodo-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (2, 392
mg, 1 mmol), 3,4-dimethylphenylboronic acid (225 mg, 1.5 mmol), Na2CO3
(318 mg, 3 mmol), TPPTS (71 mg, 0.125 mmol), and Pd(OAc)2 (11 mg, 0.05
mmol) in water/MeCN (2:1, 5 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3 h. After
cooling, the mixture was neutralized using aqueous HCl (1 M) and
concentrated to dryness in vacuo. The residue was loaded on silica by
co-evaporation from chloroform/MeOH solution, and column chromatography
(SiO2, 0→2.5% MeOH in CHCl3).
4-Amino-5-(thianthren-1-yl)-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine
(1af). Compound 1af (408 mg, 85%) was prepared as described for 1t from 2
(392 mg, 1 mmol) and thianthren-1-ylboronic acid. White solid, which was
crystallized from MeOH. Mp 227-228 °C. [α]D -19.4 (c 0.377, DMSO). 1H NMR
(600.1 MHz, DMSO-d 6): 3.55 (ddd, 1H, J gem = 12.0, J 5´b,OH = 6.3, J
5´b,4´ = 3.8, H-5´b); 3.65 (bddd, 1H, J gem = 12.0, J 5´a,OH = 5.0, J
5´a,4´ = 3.8, H-5´a); 3.94 (td, 1H, J 4´,5´ = 3.8, J 4´,3´ = 3.1, H-4´);
4.13 (bm, 1H, H-3´); 4.50 (bm, 1H, H-2´); 5.18 (bs, 1H, OH-3´); 5.26 (bs,
1H, OH-5´); 5.39 (bd, 1H, J OH,2´ = 5.3, OH-2´); 5.93 (bs, 2H, NH2); 6.14
(d, 1H, J 1´,2´ = 6.0, H-1´); 7.28 (td, 1H, J 8,7 = J 8,9 = 7.8, J 8,6 =
1.4, H-8-thianthr); 7.34 (td, 1H, J 7,6 = J 7,8 = 7.8, J 7,9 = 1.4,
H-7-thianthr); 7.35 (dd, 1H, J 2,3= 7.8, J 2,4 = 1.4, H-2-thianthr); 7.41
(t, 1H, J 3,2= J 3,4 = 7.8, H-3-thianthr); 7.44 (dd, 1H, J 9,8 = 7.8, J
9,7 = 1.4, H-9-thianthr); 7.579 (s, 1H, H-6); 7.582 (dd, 1H, J 6,7 = 7.8,
J 6,8 = 1.4, H-6-thianthr); 7.62 (dd, 1H, J 4,3 = 7.8, J 4,2 = 1.4,
H-4-thianthr); 8.17 (s, 1H, H-2). 13C NMR (150.9 MHz, DMSO-d 6): 61.91
(CH2-5´); 70.87 (CH-3´); 74.21 (CH-2´); 85.39 (CH-4´); 87.71 (CH-1´);
101.72 (C-4a); 113.09 (C-5); 122.87, 123.19 (CH-6); 127.99
(CH-3-thianthr); 128.35 (CH-8-thianthr); 128.52 (CH-4,7-thianthr); 128.65
(CH-6-thianthr); 129.11 (CH-9-thianthr); 130.66 (CH-2-thianthr); 134.41
(CH-4a-thianthr); 134.57 (C-1-thianthr); 135.06 (CH-9a-thianthr); 135.17
(C-5a-thianthr); 135.74 (C-10a-thianthr); 150.46 (C-7a); 152.07 (CH-2);
157.47 (C-4). IR (ATR): ν 1635, 1588, 1562, 1478, 1455, 1404, 1298, 1219,
1189, 1109, 1089, 1045, 1031, 980, 945, 799, 754, 729, 709, 617 cm-1. MS
(ESI) m/z 481 (M+H), 503 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for C23H21N4O4S2 [M+H] calcd:
481.0999; found: 481.0997. Anal. (C23H20N4O4S2•½H2O): C, H, N. Calcd for
C23H20N4O4S2•½H2O: C, 56.43; H, 4.32; N, 11.44. Found: C, 56.53; H, 4.18;
N, 11.25.
