$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of 2-phenylthiophene
(5,5',5''-(2-([2,2'-bithiophen]-5-yl)ethene-1,1,2-triyl)-tris(thiophene-5,2-diyl))tris(trimethylsilane)
(5T). A mixture of 4T-Br (108.1 mg, 0.17 mmol), thiophen-2-ylboronic acid
(23.4 mg, 0.18 mmol, 1.05 equiv), Pd(PPh3)4 (8.5 mg, 0.007 mmol), and
K2CO3 aq (1.5 mL, 2 M) in THF (7 mL) was refluxed at 85 °C and stirred
under argon for 20 h. After cooling to room temperature, the mixture was
quenched with H2O (5 mL), extracted with CHCl3 (2×5 mL) and then washed
with H2O (2×5 mL). After drying over MgSO4, the solvent was removed in
vacuo. The residue was purified by column chromatography on silica gel
with petroleum ether (60-90 °C)/chloroform (9:2, v/v) to yield 5T. Orange
solid, yield92.7 mg, 85.2%. Mp: 130-131 °C. 1H NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz) δ
(ppm): 7.21-7.18 (t, 3H), 7.08-7.04 (t, 4H), 7.01-6.98 (t, 2H), 6.85 (d,
J = 3.2 Hz, 1H), 6.71 (d, J = 4.0 Hz, 1H), 0.35 (d, J = 4.4 Hz, 18H),
0.28 (s, 9H). 13C NMR (CDCl3, 100 MHz) δ (ppm)： 148.16, 147.92, 143.45,
143.27, 143.25, 143.13, 139.23, 137.45, 133.97, 133.77, 133.01, 131.28,
131.19, 131.00, 130.83, 127.73, 127.49, 127.18, 124.34, 123.38, 122.82,
0.03, -0.02, -0.15. IR (KBr): 2954, 2894 (C-H) cm-1. HRMS (Tesla FTMS):
m/z calcd for [C31H38S5Si3] 654.0883, found 654.0879.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
